<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30443" root="علو" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَعْلٍ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْتَلٍ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِىٌّ</span>, last quarter: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُعَلِّى</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اليَدُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُسْتَعْلِيَةُ</span> means (assumed tropical:)  <i>The hand of him who takes by
force,</i> and <i>of the plunderer,</i> and <i>the like:</i> opposed
to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اليَدُ المُسْتَخْفِيَةُ</span>: the Sunneh ordains that the
latter shall be cut off [except in certain cases] but
not the former. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خقى</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحُرُوفُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُسْتَعْلِيَةُ</span> [<i>The high,</i> or <i>elevated, letters</i>] are <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ص</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ض</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ط</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظ</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غ</span>, <i>and</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span>; (K, TA;) in which is
a rising [of the tongue] to the palate; with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِطْبَاق</span>
[of the tongue (see 4 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طبق</span>)] except in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span>: opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُنْخَفِضَةُ</span>. (TA.)

